<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Apex Jitter Aim for all weapons</Major>
    <Description>Jitter Aim + Recoil control on all weapons. 

Res: 2k
Mouse Sens: 1.5 ADS 1.0, DPI 800
FOV: 110

The mouse cursor can be adusted to value 4 if needed but 3 worked best for me.</Description>
    <Comment>works well just standing still, works best with normal strafe. </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>1</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>LeftDown 1
MoveR 3 0
Delay 8 ms
MoveR 3 1
Delay 8 ms
MoveR -3 0
Delay 8 ms
MoveR -3 1
Delay 8 ms
GoWhile 2 50000
LeftUp 1</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Apex Legends</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>